                <pb facs="0350" n="300" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg300"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pringle to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic">March 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Requests Department to suggest that he go on the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ranger</hi> to Araapala to meet Consul Peterson.</p>
            </div>
